   "en": "Despite its apparent insignificance, Yugoslavia does not go unnoticed by the major powers. ⟦0⟧ has the national focuses ⟦1⟧ and ⟦2⟧. The former allows Germany to demand Slovenia, with refusal leading to war, while the latter can result in the partition of Yugoslavia into Croatia and Yugoslavia, with one state annexed and the other puppeted, or both puppeted.",
