  {
   "k": "1f9kjjq",
   "en": "⟦0⟧ also has multiple national decisions targeting Yugoslavia, including ⟦1⟧, ⟦2⟧, ⟦3⟧, and ⟦4⟧. These stem from the ⟦5⟧ focus in the Foreign Affairs sub-branch, potentially leading to the annexation of Dalmatia, the seizure of Montenegro, or the puppeting of Yugoslavia. ⟦6⟧ additionally removes Yugoslav core status from Kosovo, transferring it to the Italian-controlled puppet ⟦7⟧.",
